Update JavaScript to wire the new button and remove old panel implementation:

**Part A: Remove Old Panel Button Handler (ui/html/js/main.js)**
1. Locate the panelUploadBtn event listener added in Phase 3 (around line 1757)
2. Delete the entire handler block:
   ```javascript
   const panelUploadBtn = document.getElementById("btn-selected-collector-upload");
   if (panelUploadBtn) {
       panelUploadBtn.addEventListener("click", async function() {
           try {
               await triggerToolbarComboUpload();
               if (typeof window.refreshUploadsGroupAfterStorageChange === "function") {
                   window.refreshUploadsGroupAfterStorageChange();
               }
           } catch (e) {
               console.error("Upload failed:", e);
           }
       });
   }
   ```
3. Result: No orphaned listeners or references

**Part B: Add New Popup Upload Button Handler (ui/html/js/main.js)**
1. Locate where popup buttons are wired (near manageBtn.addEventListener, around line 1757)
2. Add new handler for popup upload button after the manageBtn handler:
   ```javascript
   const popupUploadBtn = document.getElementById("btn-uploads-popup-upload");
   if (popupUploadBtn) {
       popupUploadBtn.addEventListener("click", async function() {
           try {
               await triggerToolbarComboUpload();
               // Refresh uploads in popup and dropdown
               if (typeof window.refreshUploadsGroupAfterStorageChange === "function") {
                   window.refreshUploadsGroupAfterStorageChange();
               }
               // Refresh popup contents to show new upload
               populateUploadsPopup();
           } catch (e) {
               console.error("Upload failed:", e);
           }
       });
   }
   ```
3. Handler calls:
   - triggerToolbarComboUpload() - opens file dialog and handles upload
   - refreshUploadsGroupAfterStorageChange() - updates Uploads group in dropdown
   - populateUploadsPopup() - refreshes popup list to show newly uploaded file
4. Includes error handling with console logging

**Files Modified:**
- ui/html/js/main.js (removed old handler, added new handler)
